Read README.md, API.md and data/README.md. This lab is ungraded and has no submissions. Task 1 is a photo sketch or a whiteboard/PPT design. Task 2 allows paper overlays or optional AI-assisted low-fidelity coding. Task 3 uses actual video and implements at least one interaction for a general viewer. Follow the student's chosen design, not a fixed feature checklist. Preserve the original aspect ratio, stable centerline positions, smooth interpolation and source notices. Exercise time 0 corresponds to original video 5 s. distanceM and videoPoint.x are different coordinate systems. Ranks and lane polygons are estimates. Use classic scripts for file://; custom fetch/module use needs HTTP. No mandatory AI feature. Test playback, seeking, lane picking and any new interaction. Never claim Windows acceptance from a macOS run.
